#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:206
msgid "PowerDevil was compiled without Xss and Xext support, or the XSync extension is not available. Determining idle time will not be possible. Please consider recompiling PowerDevil with at least one of these two libraries."
msgstr "De Stroomdüvel wöör ahn Ünnerstütten för \"Xss\" un \"Xext\" kompileert, oder de \"XSync\"-Verwiedern is nich verföögbor. Fastmaken vun de Tiet vun't Nixdoon is so nich mööglich. Överlegg Di bitte, wat Du den Stroomdüvel nich mit tominnst een vun de twee Bibliotheken nieg kompileren wullt."

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:212
msgid "No scaling methods were found. If your CPU is reasonably recent, this is probably because you have not loaded some kernel modules. Usually scaling modules have names similar to cpufreq_ondemand. Scaling is useful and can save a lot of battery. Click on \"Attempt Loading Modules\" to let PowerDevil try to load the required modules. If you are sure your PC does not support scaling, you can also disable this warning by clicking \"Do not display this warning again\"."
msgstr "Keen Topassmetoden funnen. Is Dien Perzesser nieg noog, hest Du wull wat vun de nödigen Kernelmodulen nich laadt. Frequenztopass-Modulen hebbt normalerwies Naams liek to \"cpufreq_ondemand\". Frequenztopassen spoort en Barg Batterie. Klick op \"Modulen laden\", wenn de Stroomdüvel dat versöken un de nödigen Modulen laden schall. Büst Du seker, Dien Reekner ünnerstütt keen Frequenztopassen, kannst Du ok \"Disse Mellen nich nochmaal wiesen\" anmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:219
msgid "Attempt loading Modules"
msgstr "Modulen laden"

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:220
msgid "Do not display this warning again"
msgstr "Disse Mellen nich nochmaal wieder"

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:223
msgid "PowerDevil was compiled without Xext support, or the XSync extension is not available. XSync grants extra efficiency and performance, saving your battery and CPU. It is advised to use PowerDevil with XSync enabled."
msgstr "De Stroomdüvel wöör ahn Ünnerstütten för \"Xext\" kompileert, oder de \"XSync\"-Verwiedern is nich verföögbor. XSync stellt besünner Effitschenz un Leisten praat, dat schuult Batterie un Perzesser. Op't Best bruukst Du den Stroomdüvel mit XSync."

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:242 kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:250
msgid "No issues found with your configuration."
msgstr "Keen snaaksch Saken binnen de Instellen funnen."

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:244
msgid "XSync does not seem your preferred query backend, though it is available on your system. Using it largely improves performance and efficiency, and it is strongly advised. Click on the button below to enable it now."
msgstr "As't lett is XSync nich Dien vörtrocken Hülpprogramm för Systeemaffragen, liekers dat verföögbor is. Sien Bruuk verbetert allmeen de Leisten un Effitschenz un is redig anraadt. Klick op den Knoop nerrn, wenn Du dat nu anmaken wullt."

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:247
msgid "Enable XSync Backend"
msgstr "XSync-Hülpprogramm bruken"

#. +> trunk
#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:344
msgid "No CPU scaling kernel modules were found. Maybe you did not install them, or PowerDevil could not find them"
msgstr "Keen Frequenztopass-Kernelmodulen funnen. Villicht sünd de nich installeert, oder de Stroomdüvel kann se nich finnen."

